<title>GERMANY: Henkel 96 dividend jumps 14.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Henkel 96 dividend jumps 14.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dividend on common shares		1.20    vs 1.05 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend on preference shares	  1.30    vs 1.15 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals group is Henkel KGaA.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
